1
00:01:38,599 --> 00:01:40,719
How old were you in 1985?

2
00:01:42,079 --> 00:01:42,840
Why do you ask?

3
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:47,640
Pilot Xiao Changfei

4
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:49,120
flew over from the other side.

5
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:50,680
Do you know about this?

6
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,439
Rewarded with a thousand taels of gold.

7
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:54,719
Everyone knows that.

8
00:01:55,439 --> 00:01:56,439
Did you know him?

9
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:58,200
At the celebration ceremony,

10
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,680
a singer sang for him,

11
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:01,760
and gave him a cassette.

12
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,560
There was also a flower presentation.

13
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:06,079
The kid who presented flowers to Captain Xiao...

14
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:08,240
That was me.

15
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,520
I presented them.

16
00:02:12,319 --> 00:02:15,520
Because my uncle was in the

17
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,400
"Intelligence Bureau" back then.

18
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:21,599
A legacy running in your blood.

19
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:24,439
How is your uncle doing now?

20
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,159
He's dead.

21
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:28,800
Died a long time ago.

22
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,840
I actually never even met him.

23
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,319
Amitabha.

24
00:02:38,879 --> 00:02:40,039
How is the textile factory

25
00:02:40,319 --> 00:02:43,199
your father runs in Taoyuan doing?

26
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,840
After he broke his leg,

27
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,639
it hasn't been doing so well.

28
00:02:47,159 --> 00:02:48,199
He borrowed a lot of money,

29
00:02:48,439 --> 00:02:49,439
including from loan sharks.

30
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:51,400
If everything goes as expected,

31
00:02:51,759 --> 00:02:53,000
it will go bankrupt by the end of the year.

32
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:54,800
Excellent.

33
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,840
This will all serve as useful background for you.

34
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:00,639
Give me your hand.

35
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,520
Sir, no, I can't.

36
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,240
That is an order.

37
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:09,800
Come on.

38
00:03:20,759 --> 00:03:22,800
A boss has to wear a gold watch.

39
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,719
This will be your new identity.

40
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:27,280
Once you reach the mainland,

41
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,280
run your business well,

42
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,360
and keep your nose clean.

43
00:03:29,479 --> 00:03:31,439
When you return to report back one day,

44
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,960
you have to get me a pricier one.

45
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:36,800
If you amount to nothing,

46
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:39,759
it means I, Lao Zhu, misjudged you.

47
00:03:40,199 --> 00:03:42,120
And I'll accept my loss.

48
00:03:48,919 --> 00:03:49,840
If I don't get the job done,

49
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,560
or make a fortune,

50
00:03:52,159 --> 00:03:53,199
I will never come back.

51
00:03:59,639 --> 00:04:01,240
Just like Xiao Changfei,

52
00:04:02,199 --> 00:04:03,840
you will also become a legend.

53
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:30,399
Taipei received high-level intelligence

54
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:32,240
straight to Zheng Guiping.

55
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,519
I saw part of it.

56
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:34,920
This proves that

57
00:04:35,319 --> 00:04:37,000
the Minzhong State Security Bureau's channels

58
00:04:37,759 --> 00:04:38,920
are wide open.

59
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:43,319
They can send people in anytime, anywhere

60
00:04:43,879 --> 00:04:45,519
to work right next to you.

61
00:04:45,519 --> 00:04:48,079
Mainland or Taiwan, China, new or old,

62
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:48,839
in an endless stream.

63
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:51,680
Lee Teng-hui has always wanted to "visit the US."

64
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,120
If this trip happens,

65
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,160
that will be the fuse.

66
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,600
Both sides will prepare for this.

67
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:58,600
All intel channels will be activated.

68
00:04:59,079 --> 00:05:00,040
When the time comes,

69
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:02,560
Mawei Naval Port, the military region compound,

70
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,720
Institutes 761, 762, and 766.

71
00:05:04,839 --> 00:05:05,959
It's a massive game of chess.

72
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:08,040
All the pieces will be in motion.

73
00:05:37,199 --> 00:05:38,439
Tomorrow morning at 8:00.

74
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,839
Each of you gets a mission.

75
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:42,519
He Chunxiao.

76
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,839
Go to the Electrical Institute's dorms.

77
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:47,319
Look into the person in this photo.

78
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:51,720
Sir, do you happen to recognize this person?

79
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:54,240
He said he lived here for seven years before.

80
00:05:54,639 --> 00:05:55,639
Doesn't ring a bell.

81
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,560
Ma'am.

82
00:05:56,959 --> 00:05:58,120
Do you know this person?

83
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,519
He said he lived here for seven years.

84
00:05:59,519 --> 00:06:00,519
Never seen him.

85
00:06:01,639 --> 00:06:03,439
Last name Wei. Ring a bell?

86
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:05,439
Jinlan, go to the long-distance bus station.

87
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,959
See if this person is connected to it.

88
00:06:07,959 --> 00:06:09,040
He's my uncle from back home.

89
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:11,199
We relatives have no other way to contact each other.

90
00:06:11,199 --> 00:06:12,360
All I have is a photo.

91
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,079
Please take a look.

92
00:06:13,079 --> 00:06:13,720
Huadong.

93
00:06:14,079 --> 00:06:15,399
Go to the Minzhong Auto Factory.

94
00:06:15,759 --> 00:06:17,720
Find out everything about his background.

95
00:06:18,079 --> 00:06:20,319
Bring back whatever files you can get.

96
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,800
By any means necessary,

97
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,879
you must get it done.

98
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,120
This is not a drill.

99
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:27,399
It's your final assessment.

100
00:06:28,199 --> 00:06:28,800
Remember.

101
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:31,560
When cops catch thieves, they shouldn't think like cops.

102
00:06:31,879 --> 00:06:32,600
Think like a thief.

103
00:06:32,759 --> 00:06:34,399
When you learn how to steal,

104
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,959
you'll find the key.

105
00:06:40,279 --> 00:06:41,040
Ma'am.

106
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,879
Could you take a look and see if you know this person?

107
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,399
I don't know him.

108
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:46,639
Ma'am, could you please help me check?

109
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,920
He said he lived here for seven years.

110
00:06:50,879 --> 00:06:51,759
State Security Bureau.

111
00:06:52,319 --> 00:06:53,360
What kind of department is that?

112
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:54,439
What do they do?

113
00:06:56,639 --> 00:06:58,079
It's a classified agency.

114
00:06:58,399 --> 00:07:00,040
Hello. City Transit Bureau.

115
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,240
Hello, nice to meet you.

116
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:03,639
I need the Passenger, Service, Dispatch,

117
00:07:03,639 --> 00:07:04,639
along with Maintenance,

118
00:07:04,639 --> 00:07:06,360
and Consignment offices' staff lists.

119
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:06,879
Thank you.

120
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,000
Run!

121
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:19,920
I told you not to go in!

122
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:20,600
Move, move, move!

123
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,560
Come with me.

124
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,079
Move.

125
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,720
I knew something was off about you.

126
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:26,600
You little thief!

127
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,319
I'm not a thief.

128
00:07:27,879 --> 00:07:28,639
Passenger Transport Department.

129
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,240
Thank you.

130
00:07:30,439 --> 00:07:31,199
Service Team.

131
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,360
Is this the police station?

132
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:36,199
Someone claims to be from State Security.

133
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,839
He came to our dorm area

134
00:07:37,839 --> 00:07:39,000
to investigate.

135
00:07:39,279 --> 00:07:41,240
Isn't this your jurisdiction?

136
00:07:41,879 --> 00:07:42,560
What?

137
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,160
What do you mean, a classified unit?

138
00:07:52,879 --> 00:07:53,879
Su Lina.

139
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:55,759
And Jinlan?

140
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,240
Jinlan again.

141
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,160
He Chunxiao.

142
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,279
Li Huadong.

143
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:02,519
Wang Zhenhua.

144
00:08:04,439 --> 00:08:05,480
You're just in time.

145
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,720
Pour the leaders some water.

146
00:08:07,519 --> 00:08:08,040
I'll do it.

147
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:08,439
I'll do it.

148
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:09,040
I got it, I got it.

149
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:09,959
Let Ma Qi do it.

150
00:08:09,959 --> 00:08:10,759
Sure thing.

151
00:08:13,959 --> 00:08:15,079
Tomorrow morning at 8:00,

152
00:08:15,079 --> 00:08:17,399
go to the Power Dispatch Center's dorms

153
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:19,439
and thoroughly investigate this suspect.

154
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,240
This is Ma Qi.

155
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:30,920
Let me pour you some.

156
00:08:33,639 --> 00:08:35,360
Hold on, hold on.

157
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,240
Late again.

158
00:08:36,279 --> 00:08:37,159
There's still five seconds left.

159
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:37,879
Doesn't count as late.

160
00:08:37,879 --> 00:08:38,919
What is all this?

161
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,159
I've tried everything.

162
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:41,960
I still can't find the data you want.

163
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:44,000
These are duty rosters, name lists,

164
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,039
payroll and bonus records,

165
00:08:45,039 --> 00:08:46,720
and the retirees' statistics.

166
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,039
I've checked everyone.

167
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:49,440
I can't find the person you mentioned.

168
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,879
Unless he changed his name long ago.

169
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:52,039
But we wouldn't know.

170
00:08:57,759 --> 00:08:58,879
Also,

171
00:08:58,879 --> 00:09:00,519
you need to visit the police station.

172
00:09:00,519 --> 00:09:01,320
Because in the end, they called

173
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,399
the higher-ups to verify,

174
00:09:02,399 --> 00:09:03,240
and my cover was blown.

175
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,159
They were calling the police as I left.

176
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:11,720
Leaders,

177
00:09:11,879 --> 00:09:12,840
all trainees are present.

178
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,960
We can begin.

179
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:39,200
It's so empty for a Sunday.

180
00:09:40,159 --> 00:09:41,759
Cinema really is dying.

181
00:09:42,519 --> 00:09:43,840
Haven't you been wanting to head out?

182
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:44,720
Raring to go.

183
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,919
The higher-ups did you a favor.

184
00:09:47,799 --> 00:09:48,480
You're cleared.

185
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,240
To head over there.

186
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,159
Right now?

187
00:09:53,759 --> 00:09:54,320
Yes.

188
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:56,159
I feel like...

189
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,639
I'm not ready.

190
00:09:57,639 --> 00:10:00,559
The best training is done in the field.

191
00:10:00,639 --> 00:10:01,480
It was the same for me.

192
00:10:07,039 --> 00:10:08,559
How many days do I have to prepare?

193
00:10:08,559 --> 00:10:09,320
Three hours.

194
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,519
Three hours?

195
00:10:10,519 --> 00:10:11,919
I haven't packed a single thing.

196
00:10:11,919 --> 00:10:13,360
I haven't even bought a toothbrush.

197
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:16,039
We've got everything ready for you.

198
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,240
You are now a

199
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:35,559
businessman suspected of economic fraud,

200
00:10:36,279 --> 00:10:39,000
with investment funds swindled in Taipei.

201
00:10:39,879 --> 00:10:41,440
You'll follow a Taiwan business group

202
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,879
to inspect projects in Minzhong

203
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:43,759
and put down roots there.

204
00:10:44,879 --> 00:10:45,559
Understood.

205
00:10:45,919 --> 00:10:47,240
If you're exposed and arrested,

206
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:50,759
the higher-ups will save you at all costs

207
00:10:50,759 --> 00:10:52,279
and find a way to get you back.

208
00:10:53,759 --> 00:10:54,639
But,

209
00:10:55,159 --> 00:10:57,759
if your personal matters on the mainland

210
00:10:57,759 --> 00:10:59,080
lead you to commit a crime,

211
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:01,240
even God won't protect you.

212
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,639
You'll go to prison if that's your sentence,

213
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:03,919
or face the firing squad.

214
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:08,480
I know.

215
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:10,720
Safe travels.

216
00:11:27,679 --> 00:11:29,279
Ladies and gentlemen,

217
00:11:29,399 --> 00:11:31,720
our plane is about to begin its descent

218
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,600
into Minzhong Airport.

219
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:36,080
Please return to your seats

220
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,480
and fasten your seatbelts.

221
00:11:37,679 --> 00:11:39,320
Ensure your seatbacks are upright,

222
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:40,600
stow your tray tables,

223
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,879
and open your window blinds.

224
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,399
You are not alone.

225
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:49,200
Many of our comrades are across the strait,

226
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,960
and they will be right by your side.

227
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:53,759
Perhaps one day, someone you brush past,

228
00:11:53,759 --> 00:11:55,679
a seemingly unremarkable passerby,

229
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:57,840
is one of our own.

230
00:11:59,039 --> 00:12:00,480
You all operate via single-line contact.

231
00:12:00,679 --> 00:12:03,159
They span the party, government, and military,

232
00:12:03,279 --> 00:12:04,360
embedded in different sectors,

233
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,759
carrying out different tasks.

234
00:12:35,639 --> 00:12:37,919
Welcome to Minzhong Airport.

235
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:40,159
Please queue in the available lanes.

236
00:12:40,159 --> 00:12:41,519
Please prepare your ID cards in advance,

237
00:12:41,519 --> 00:12:42,919
passports, and relevant documents,

238
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:45,480
and cooperate with border and customs.

239
00:12:45,759 --> 00:12:48,279
For assistance, please ask an officer on duty

240
00:12:48,279 --> 00:12:50,240
or proceed to the passenger service center.

241
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:51,360
Thank you for your cooperation.

242
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,519
Have a pleasant trip.

243
00:12:57,759 --> 00:12:59,240
Comrade, routine inspection.

244
00:12:59,519 --> 00:13:00,799
Please show your documents.

245
00:13:03,639 --> 00:13:05,120
What is the purpose of your visit to Minzhong?

246
00:13:06,159 --> 00:13:07,919
Hello, please show your documents.

247
00:13:11,919 --> 00:13:13,120
What brings you here?

248
00:13:13,279 --> 00:13:14,360
It's International Investment Month.

249
00:13:14,679 --> 00:13:15,519
Looking to make some investments.

250
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:28,000
Come in. Welcome.

251
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:29,519
Thank you.

252
00:13:29,759 --> 00:13:30,320
Please.

253
00:13:30,759 --> 00:13:31,399
Excuse me.

254
00:13:31,399 --> 00:13:32,159
Thank you. Thank you.

255
00:13:32,159 --> 00:13:32,720
Let's go.

256
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:35,399
Next.

257
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,399
Hello. Please show your ID.

258
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:54,600
Hello. Do you have any canned goods in your luggage?

259
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,159
Pork floss from Taiwan, China.

260
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,440
I've brought it before.

261
00:13:58,759 --> 00:13:59,480
Is there a problem?

262
00:13:59,879 --> 00:14:01,080
We implemented new regulations yesterday.

263
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:02,440
Please head to the inspection station.

264
00:14:02,919 --> 00:14:03,519
This way, please.

265
00:14:09,399 --> 00:14:10,559
Okay, next.

266
00:14:11,159 --> 00:14:12,120
Please show your ID.

267
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:33,720
Hello.

268
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:41,120
Take a seat.

269
00:14:47,799 --> 00:14:49,240
Do you need to inspect my luggage?

270
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,879
Since the first weekend of last March,

271
00:14:51,879 --> 00:14:52,720
up to now,

272
00:14:53,399 --> 00:14:55,440
this is your 17th visit to the mainland.

273
00:14:57,519 --> 00:14:58,559
You always went to Xiamen before.

274
00:14:59,279 --> 00:15:00,600
Why did you come here first today?

275
00:15:03,559 --> 00:15:04,799
What's wrong with my luggage?

276
00:15:04,799 --> 00:15:05,759
Your luggage is fine.

277
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:07,360
I'm just asking out of curiosity.

278
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,000
So tell me.

279
00:15:09,639 --> 00:15:10,879
You've been traveling so frequently lately.

280
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:12,320
How much intel did you gather?

281
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:13,559
To be in such a hurry to send it back.

282
00:15:18,799 --> 00:15:19,759
Airport extortion.

283
00:15:20,799 --> 00:15:22,120
I've encountered it in other countries too.

284
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:25,000
Comrade, what do you want?

285
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:27,879
US dollars or RMB?

286
00:15:31,559 --> 00:15:32,480
Forty minutes ago,

287
00:15:32,879 --> 00:15:34,480
someone searched your Xiamen apartment

288
00:15:34,480 --> 00:15:35,759
and found some things.

289
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:36,960
Want to know what they are?

290
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,960
There's nothing wrong with any of my things.

291
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:50,279
I want to see your airport police chief.

292
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,080
I'm reporting this.

293
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,559
You're a devout Buddhist vegetarian.

294
00:15:53,559 --> 00:15:54,480
Devoted to doing good.

295
00:15:54,759 --> 00:15:56,639
So who is all that pork floss for?

296
00:15:58,360 --> 00:15:59,519
Your lover?

297
00:16:03,039 --> 00:16:04,240
What do you mean?

298
00:16:05,039 --> 00:16:06,919
Yuquan, Datong District, Taipei.

299
00:16:07,159 --> 00:16:08,320
You have a loving wife,

300
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,240
an adorable son,

301
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,120
and a respectable family.

302
00:16:11,399 --> 00:16:13,360
Over here on Donghu Street, Fengze District,

303
00:16:14,399 --> 00:16:17,080
your lover also has a wife,

304
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:20,120
a lovely daughter, and a respectable job.

305
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:22,279
Both sides are living in peace.

306
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,759
And everything works out perfectly for you.

307
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:30,679
You work for so many intelligence agencies,

308
00:16:30,799 --> 00:16:32,120
serving so many masters.

309
00:16:32,639 --> 00:16:33,759
Why haven't we arrested you?

310
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:36,080
Why am I talking to you alone here?

311
00:16:37,519 --> 00:16:38,759
It's to give you a chance,

312
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:40,519
and perhaps make a friend.

313
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:44,039
Walk out this door,

314
00:16:44,039 --> 00:16:45,039
and you remain who you are.

315
00:16:46,279 --> 00:16:47,559
The pork floss will be returned to you.

316
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:49,960
The porn video wrapped in the scarf

317
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:51,000
will also be returned to you.

318
00:16:51,799 --> 00:16:52,879
You can work for them,

319
00:16:52,879 --> 00:16:54,080
or you can work for us.

320
00:16:54,559 --> 00:16:55,759
You are a spy for Taiwan, China.

321
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:58,840
If you don't, I'll arrest you right now.

322
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,360
From your family's hospital,

323
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:03,240
the STD records from the dermatology clinic,

324
00:17:03,519 --> 00:17:04,559
and from the darkroom,

325
00:17:04,559 --> 00:17:06,200
the sex photos you developed yourself,

326
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:08,319
will become your belongings upon arrest

327
00:17:08,319 --> 00:17:09,720
and be sent back to your hometown.

328
00:17:10,079 --> 00:17:11,119
They will appear at your father's

329
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:13,039
80th birthday party in the ancestral hall,

330
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:15,400
in front of the entire Yang family.

331
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:18,720
Do you understand?

332
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:28,599
From the minute you started this job,

333
00:17:28,599 --> 00:17:30,039
you should have expected this day would come.

334
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:32,240
It's agonizing, isn't it?

335
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:33,319
It can't be helped.

336
00:17:33,759 --> 00:17:35,200
You just have to bear it.

337
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:36,720
It's your fault for falling into my hands.

338
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,279
Are you done venting?

339
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:01,279
Once you've thought it over, sign it.

340
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:30,279
Who told you to do this?

341
00:18:30,279 --> 00:18:31,680
If the intel is reliable,

342
00:18:31,759 --> 00:18:33,200
once he takes the items and leaves this time,

343
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:34,759
he most likely won't come back.

344
00:18:34,759 --> 00:18:35,480
The fish is already in the net.

345
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,279
Aren't you going to haul it in?

346
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:38,000
Exactly, we tried so many methods before,

347
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:38,799
tried to turn him,

348
00:18:38,799 --> 00:18:39,839
but never succeeded.

349
00:18:39,839 --> 00:18:41,559
This really is the last chance.

350
00:18:41,559 --> 00:18:42,359
Bullshit.

351
00:18:42,839 --> 00:18:44,000
So you just act recklessly because there's no chance?

352
00:18:44,079 --> 00:18:45,200
This is a protocol violation.

353
00:18:45,319 --> 00:18:46,599
And the two of you worked together?

354
00:18:47,559 --> 00:18:48,039
Chief Wei.

355
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:50,119
Let me go buy your cigarettes first.

356
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:56,359
About what just happened,

357
00:18:56,359 --> 00:18:57,279
it has nothing to do with him.

358
00:18:59,880 --> 00:19:00,799
Here's the self-criticism I just wrote.

359
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:02,039
I couldn't find a desk,

360
00:19:02,039 --> 00:19:02,839
so the handwriting is a bit messy.

361
00:19:04,400 --> 00:19:05,799
Why didn't you report this in advance?

362
00:19:05,799 --> 00:19:06,839
I paged you.

363
00:19:06,839 --> 00:19:07,799
You didn't reply.

364
00:19:14,839 --> 00:19:17,039
You think he'd be your double agent?

365
00:19:17,279 --> 00:19:19,240
Do you think this guy is reliable?

366
00:19:19,599 --> 00:19:20,680
At least he is today.

367
00:19:20,799 --> 00:19:21,400
Reliable for what?

368
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:23,920
To give you Grade-A intel.

369
00:19:24,599 --> 00:19:27,480
The Military Intelligence Bureau gave me a mission.

370
00:19:29,759 --> 00:19:31,119
They want me to awaken someone,

371
00:19:31,440 --> 00:19:34,039
to be a courier for my next phase of work.

372
00:19:37,519 --> 00:19:38,920
Name? Identity?

373
00:19:39,079 --> 00:19:40,319
I won't be meeting him.

374
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:42,799
They will notify him separately.

375
00:19:43,039 --> 00:19:46,400
I only know he's left-handed and takes photos.

376
00:19:46,680 --> 00:19:47,720
His cover identity

377
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:50,279
might be a photographer.

378
00:19:52,200 --> 00:19:53,400
How long has he been here?

379
00:19:53,839 --> 00:19:54,519
What else is he in charge of?

380
00:19:55,039 --> 00:19:56,400
He's probably been here a while.

381
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:57,960
What exactly did he do before?

382
00:19:59,039 --> 00:19:59,839
I'm not sure.

383
00:19:59,960 --> 00:20:00,960
I asked once.

384
00:20:01,480 --> 00:20:04,440
It seems he was also gathering intel before.

385
00:20:06,519 --> 00:20:07,319
Go on.

386
00:20:11,319 --> 00:20:12,160
Earlier,

387
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:16,079
I heard something at the Military Intelligence Bureau.

388
00:20:16,839 --> 00:20:18,720
Someone handled by the Intel Department.

389
00:20:19,039 --> 00:20:20,359
The clearance level is very high.

390
00:20:20,599 --> 00:20:21,680
If all goes well,

391
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:23,200
they'll arrive in the next couple of days.

392
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:29,160
A long-term sleeper or a short-term mission?

393
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:30,839
I'm just a nobody.

394
00:20:31,799 --> 00:20:33,720
I already know too much.

395
00:20:34,880 --> 00:20:35,680
What do you think?

396
00:20:37,400 --> 00:20:38,880
The intel is reliable.

397
00:20:39,279 --> 00:20:40,400
The person might not be.

398
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:42,440
But since we've made this breakthrough today,

399
00:20:42,759 --> 00:20:44,799
I have to choose to trust and groom him,

400
00:20:45,599 --> 00:20:48,160
until he trusts me the most.

401
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:55,119
Think it through.

402
00:20:56,720 --> 00:20:57,920
I feel that in anyone's entire life,

403
00:20:57,960 --> 00:20:59,759
as long as they're useful for one thing,

404
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:01,240
this fish wasn't caught in vain.

405
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:02,759
Then this operation was worth it.

406
00:21:04,519 --> 00:21:05,880
As long as he's still in this business,

407
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:07,000
and he's still on the mainland,

408
00:21:07,519 --> 00:21:08,359
I'm not afraid.

409
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:11,279
You're gambling.

410
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:13,240
The stakes aren't high.

411
00:21:13,359 --> 00:21:14,440
I can afford to bet.

412
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:18,960
Finding a place to buy a pack of smokes

413
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:21,519
was a real hassle. Come, come.

414
00:21:21,920 --> 00:21:22,960
Chief Wei, have a smoke.

415
00:21:23,079 --> 00:21:23,880
Stop kissing ass.

416
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:25,960
What are you hiding from?

417
00:21:26,680 --> 00:21:27,720
Go back and redo your self-criticism.

418
00:21:29,599 --> 00:21:31,559
Go investigate that

419
00:21:31,559 --> 00:21:32,799
left-handed photographer he mentioned.

420
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:34,799
The Military Intelligence Bureau has played their card.

421
00:21:35,319 --> 00:21:36,599
We have to counter it.

422
00:22:03,839 --> 00:22:04,200
Engineer Cao.

423
00:22:04,200 --> 00:22:04,759
Morning, Engineer Cao.

424
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:05,480
Morning.

425
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:40,960
Mr. Cao.

426
00:22:41,359 --> 00:22:41,960
Mr. Cao.

427
00:23:09,559 --> 00:23:11,640
It's just a part-time consulting job.

428
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:13,079
It's very simple.

429
00:23:13,799 --> 00:23:14,640
Mr. Cao.

430
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:19,960
Please.

431
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:43,680
Come in.

432
00:23:45,680 --> 00:23:46,200
Director Jiao.

433
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:48,200
Lao Cao! Come on in!

434
00:23:48,680 --> 00:23:50,039
Come, come.

435
00:23:50,039 --> 00:23:51,200
Have a seat, please.

436
00:23:53,319 --> 00:23:54,200
You're just in time.

437
00:23:54,599 --> 00:23:56,000
I have some good tea here.

438
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:57,319
Since you're here,

439
00:23:57,559 --> 00:23:59,319
you can help me taste it.

440
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:01,160
During the meeting this morning,

441
00:24:01,160 --> 00:24:03,119
I was just telling Secretary Liao...

442
00:24:03,119 --> 00:24:05,720
"Tell me, with Lao Cao's suits,

443
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:07,200
does he iron them himself,

444
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:08,599
or does his wife do it?"

445
00:24:08,680 --> 00:24:09,720
Looking so sharp every day,

446
00:24:10,079 --> 00:24:11,720
he doesn't look like a scientist at all.

447
00:24:11,720 --> 00:24:13,759
More like a TV studio host.

448
00:24:16,559 --> 00:24:19,119
Since my first day here, I've heard

449
00:24:19,119 --> 00:24:20,119
that no matter what you do,

450
00:24:20,119 --> 00:24:21,119
you need a talent for it.

451
00:24:21,359 --> 00:24:23,240
Doing research is just like ironing clothes,

452
00:24:23,240 --> 00:24:24,119
it requires talent too.

453
00:24:24,559 --> 00:24:25,559
My wife just doesn't have it.

454
00:24:25,559 --> 00:24:26,920
Even after training her for so long,

455
00:24:26,920 --> 00:24:28,279
she still hasn't got the hang of it.

456
00:24:28,559 --> 00:24:29,880
So I have to iron them myself,

457
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:31,480
and I almost end up late for work.

458
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:33,920
Did you hear about that matter?

459
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:34,720
About what?

460
00:24:34,720 --> 00:24:35,559
Well,

461
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:39,200
isn't your paper getting published next month?

462
00:24:40,279 --> 00:24:41,720
If all goes smoothly,

463
00:24:41,759 --> 00:24:43,720
your title promotion next quarter

464
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:45,119
shouldn't be a major problem.

465
00:24:48,079 --> 00:24:49,039
Here, have a taste.

466
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:50,640
Also,

467
00:24:50,920 --> 00:24:53,519
about the Deputy Chief Engineer nominee...

468
00:24:53,759 --> 00:24:56,240
My personal opinion and the institute's

469
00:24:57,000 --> 00:24:57,759
are aligned.

470
00:24:57,920 --> 00:24:58,480
We are completely aligned.

471
00:24:58,720 --> 00:25:00,880
However, there are some dissenting voices.

472
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:02,240
The general sentiment is,

473
00:25:02,240 --> 00:25:03,400
according to staff feedback,

474
00:25:03,839 --> 00:25:05,400
"With his parted hair and black shoes,

475
00:25:05,480 --> 00:25:06,599
always singing and dancing...

476
00:25:06,880 --> 00:25:08,079
we are in scientific research,

477
00:25:08,079 --> 00:25:09,319
not show business."

478
00:25:09,640 --> 00:25:11,880
If you were a newcomer, it'd be fine,

479
00:25:13,039 --> 00:25:14,119
but you're a core member here.

480
00:25:14,279 --> 00:25:15,200
You know what I mean, right?

481
00:25:15,799 --> 00:25:16,319
Come on!

482
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,319
Who said that?

483
00:25:17,440 --> 00:25:18,240
Tell me who it was.

484
00:25:18,240 --> 00:25:19,839
Just taste the tea.

485
00:25:19,839 --> 00:25:21,799
The arts and research don't conflict!

486
00:25:21,799 --> 00:25:23,400
Next week is our institute's

487
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:25,039
20th-anniversary gala.

488
00:25:25,039 --> 00:25:25,680
Are we just going to cancel it?

489
00:25:27,359 --> 00:25:28,200
I still have a meeting to get to.

490
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,240
Director Jiao, there's one more thing.

491
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:35,160
It wasn't convenient to say out there.

492
00:25:35,319 --> 00:25:37,119
I wanted to report it to the institute privately.

493
00:25:37,519 --> 00:25:37,839
Go ahead.

494
00:25:40,440 --> 00:25:41,000
Come in.

495
00:25:43,000 --> 00:25:43,519
Mr. Cao.

496
00:25:43,880 --> 00:25:44,480
Xiao Li.

497
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:45,200
Director Jiao.

498
00:25:46,279 --> 00:25:48,200
This is Engineer Jia's penalty decision.

499
00:25:48,960 --> 00:25:51,559
All Party Committee members must sign it.

500
00:25:51,759 --> 00:25:54,119
The Secretary wants it to be a warning,

501
00:25:54,240 --> 00:25:56,000
and an institute-wide criticism notice.

502
00:25:56,400 --> 00:25:57,759
A severe warning within the Party,

503
00:25:58,279 --> 00:25:59,160
and placed on probation at the institute.

504
00:25:59,440 --> 00:26:00,160
Anything else?

505
00:26:00,279 --> 00:26:01,119
Does his family know?

506
00:26:01,279 --> 00:26:02,000
Yes.

507
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:03,599
His wife came and caused a scene for hours last week.

508
00:26:03,720 --> 00:26:04,920
Caused a scene? About what?

509
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:06,599
What her husband did in Germany...

510
00:26:06,599 --> 00:26:07,720
is that the institute's responsibility too?

511
00:26:07,720 --> 00:26:08,480
She wasn't coming after the institute,

512
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:09,559
she was after him.

513
00:26:09,559 --> 00:26:11,359
She completely humiliated him.

514
00:26:11,359 --> 00:26:12,200
Alright, get back to work.

515
00:26:20,000 --> 00:26:20,559
Right.

516
00:26:21,640 --> 00:26:23,039
What were you saying just now?

517
00:26:27,960 --> 00:26:29,000
Earlier at the meeting, they mentioned

518
00:26:29,440 --> 00:26:30,599
the Decision on Deepening

519
00:26:30,599 --> 00:26:32,759
the Reform of the Urban Housing System.

520
00:26:33,039 --> 00:26:35,680
If the unit is allocating housing,

521
00:26:36,960 --> 00:26:37,920
I...

522
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:40,440
I'd like to apply for a two-bedroom place.

523
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:46,000
About that...

524
00:26:47,559 --> 00:26:49,359
The organization will make unified arrangements.

525
00:26:51,240 --> 00:26:52,000
That will be all.

526
00:26:52,359 --> 00:26:53,000
Understood.

527
00:26:56,440 --> 00:26:57,920
Welcome to International Investment Month.

528
00:26:58,599 --> 00:27:00,359
Welcome to International Investment Month.

529
00:27:00,359 --> 00:27:01,519
Turn right ahead.

530
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:03,319
Someone will be there to receive you.

531
00:27:03,319 --> 00:27:04,599
Then, take this upstairs.

532
00:27:04,599 --> 00:27:05,440
Someone will assist you up there.

533
00:27:07,279 --> 00:27:08,119
Turn right ahead.

534
00:27:08,240 --> 00:27:09,200
This way, please.

535
00:27:11,640 --> 00:27:13,079
Then just follow him.

536
00:27:14,119 --> 00:27:14,839
Okay.

537
00:27:17,799 --> 00:27:18,559
Excuse me.

538
00:27:24,160 --> 00:27:24,640
Thank you.

539
00:27:26,720 --> 00:27:27,640
Hello, welcome.

540
00:27:27,640 --> 00:27:29,000
Go upstairs and turn right.

541
00:27:29,160 --> 00:27:30,799
Welcome to International Investment Month.

542
00:27:30,799 --> 00:27:31,240
Go upstairs and turn right.

543
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:32,640
Go upstairs here and turn right.

544
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:35,960
Qian Wenying.

545
00:27:37,039 --> 00:27:38,880
First time I've seen such a beautiful ribbon.

546
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:41,400
How can I help you?

547
00:27:42,079 --> 00:27:43,240
How do I get to Hall 2?

548
00:27:43,240 --> 00:27:43,880
Hall 2.

549
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:44,960
I'll take you there. This way.

550
00:27:44,960 --> 00:27:45,759
Thanks.

551
00:27:46,319 --> 00:27:48,079
Doing volunteer work like you do,

552
00:27:48,079 --> 00:27:49,319
how much do you make each time?

553
00:27:49,319 --> 00:27:50,119
We are all students.

554
00:27:50,119 --> 00:27:51,160
We don't need to be paid.

555
00:27:51,799 --> 00:27:52,839
Why don't you want money?

556
00:27:53,200 --> 00:27:54,759
You should get paid for your labor.

557
00:27:54,880 --> 00:27:56,440
You aren't free worker ants.

558
00:27:59,359 --> 00:28:02,240
My phone and pager numbers are on this.

559
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:02,920
Later,

560
00:28:02,920 --> 00:28:04,880
go back and page me your dorm number.

561
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,599
There will be many chances to make money.

562
00:28:06,599 --> 00:28:07,720
I'll need your help a lot.

563
00:28:07,920 --> 00:28:08,799
We are still in school.

564
00:28:08,799 --> 00:28:09,839
We don't know how to do anything.

565
00:28:10,279 --> 00:28:12,119
Submitting to military magazines is easy.

566
00:28:12,119 --> 00:28:13,839
Just take lots of photos and write articles.

567
00:28:14,319 --> 00:28:15,160
Keep in touch.

568
00:28:16,119 --> 00:28:17,000
Thank you.

569
00:28:18,799 --> 00:28:19,519
Brother Wen.

570
00:28:19,519 --> 00:28:20,000
Xiaolin.

571
00:28:20,559 --> 00:28:21,240
You just arrived, right?

572
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:21,960
Just got here, just got here.

573
00:28:22,079 --> 00:28:23,599
I ran into this huge event upon arriving.

574
00:28:23,599 --> 00:28:24,720
I'm still a bit dazed.

575
00:28:24,720 --> 00:28:26,160
It's fine, just follow me.

576
00:28:26,160 --> 00:28:27,079
Mr. Wen.

577
00:28:28,160 --> 00:28:29,039
Director Wu!

578
00:28:29,240 --> 00:28:30,559
You're finally back!

579
00:28:30,559 --> 00:28:31,720
For an event you organized, brother,

580
00:28:31,720 --> 00:28:33,680
I'd have rushed back even on a bicycle.

581
00:28:34,039 --> 00:28:34,880
Thanks a lot, thanks a lot.

582
00:28:35,279 --> 00:28:36,039
Mr. Wen,

583
00:28:36,200 --> 00:28:38,319
Mayor Xie will personally host you for lunch.

584
00:28:38,440 --> 00:28:39,319
Tonight,

585
00:28:39,319 --> 00:28:41,319
let's have a drink, shall we?

586
00:28:41,400 --> 00:28:42,200
No problem.

587
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:43,759
With my homemade rice wine.

588
00:28:44,839 --> 00:28:45,640
Director Wu,

589
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:46,519
let me introduce you.

590
00:28:46,519 --> 00:28:48,880
This is a young friend from Taipei,

591
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:50,119
Mr. Lin.

592
00:28:50,519 --> 00:28:51,400
Actually, he and I

593
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:52,880
also met for the first time today.

594
00:28:52,880 --> 00:28:55,279
But my older brother personally told me

595
00:28:55,279 --> 00:28:56,759
I must take good care of him.

596
00:28:56,799 --> 00:28:59,240
He'll invest and build factories here in the future.

597
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:01,480
This is Wu Jinhe.

598
00:29:01,640 --> 00:29:03,640
Director Wu is doing a fantastic job.

599
00:29:03,640 --> 00:29:05,799
Transferred to the City Investment Bureau,

600
00:29:05,799 --> 00:29:07,400
he's definitely been promoted again now.

601
00:29:07,680 --> 00:29:08,799
No, no, no.

602
00:29:09,799 --> 00:29:10,599
Good brother,

603
00:29:11,119 --> 00:29:12,079
if Mr. Lin wants to invest,

604
00:29:12,079 --> 00:29:12,920
you must come to me.

605
00:29:13,160 --> 00:29:14,160
Assistant to the Mayor.

606
00:29:14,200 --> 00:29:15,119
A big shot.

607
00:29:15,799 --> 00:29:16,960
Well then, Mr. Wen,

608
00:29:17,720 --> 00:29:18,920
tonight will just be a small gathering.

609
00:29:19,039 --> 00:29:19,559
It's a deal.

610
00:29:19,839 --> 00:29:20,319
No problem.

611
00:29:20,440 --> 00:29:21,200
Director Wu.

612
00:29:21,960 --> 00:29:23,079
Alright, I'll get back to work.

613
00:29:23,079 --> 00:29:24,039
Go ahead, go ahead.

614
00:29:25,880 --> 00:29:28,440
A Mayor's Assistant equals a Deputy Mayor.

615
00:29:29,359 --> 00:29:30,559
It's a fake title.

616
00:29:30,559 --> 00:29:31,680
To attract investments,

617
00:29:32,160 --> 00:29:34,519
officials all get their titles bumped up.

618
00:29:34,880 --> 00:29:36,119
To show they take it seriously.

619
00:29:36,559 --> 00:29:37,640
After the conference,

620
00:29:37,640 --> 00:29:39,039
all business cards will be collected back.

621
00:29:39,720 --> 00:29:40,680
Then he is...

622
00:29:41,039 --> 00:29:42,559
Deputy Director of the Investment Bureau.

623
00:29:42,559 --> 00:29:43,559
He's in charge.

624
00:29:45,240 --> 00:29:46,039
Look over there.

625
00:29:46,079 --> 00:29:48,640
That is a real big shot.

626
00:29:48,799 --> 00:29:50,960
A genuine Deputy Mayor.

627
00:29:53,400 --> 00:29:54,279
Mayor Xie!

628
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:57,359
I'm back.

629
00:29:57,359 --> 00:29:57,799
How is it?

630
00:29:57,799 --> 00:29:59,480
Did you bring any new projects back this time?

631
00:29:59,559 --> 00:30:00,960
Just give the word, sir.

632
00:30:01,079 --> 00:30:02,079
Whatever you need us to do,

633
00:30:02,079 --> 00:30:03,000
we'll do it.

634
00:30:17,599 --> 00:30:18,359
Come in.

635
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:20,680
Director.

636
00:30:22,160 --> 00:30:23,000
I need to head out.

637
00:30:23,160 --> 00:30:24,039
You have one minute.

638
00:30:24,079 --> 00:30:24,799
Three things.

639
00:30:24,799 --> 00:30:26,079
Some chief

640
00:30:26,079 --> 00:30:27,319
or minister is visiting.

641
00:30:27,599 --> 00:30:28,559
It's a small country,

642
00:30:28,599 --> 00:30:30,000
I can't even remember the name.

643
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:31,759
They asked the Ministry of Foreign Affairs

644
00:30:31,759 --> 00:30:32,920
to arrange a meeting with Ma Qi.

645
00:30:32,920 --> 00:30:34,039
They had contact before.

646
00:30:34,279 --> 00:30:35,319
They could be considered friends.

647
00:30:35,559 --> 00:30:36,519
Tell them he's on a business trip.

648
00:30:36,720 --> 00:30:37,799
That's what I said.

649
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:39,680
The Ministry comrades are very strict.

650
00:30:40,039 --> 00:30:41,200
They asked when he'll be back.

651
00:30:42,920 --> 00:30:43,680
A business trip.

652
00:30:43,680 --> 00:30:44,839
Something went wrong on the trip.

653
00:30:44,960 --> 00:30:45,920
He ate some leftover food,

654
00:30:46,160 --> 00:30:47,279
got an upset stomach and diarrhea,

655
00:30:47,519 --> 00:30:48,680
got dehydrated, and was hospitalized.

656
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:49,559
He has to listen to the doctor.

657
00:30:49,559 --> 00:30:50,559
We don't know when he'll be discharged.

658
00:30:50,559 --> 00:30:51,359
Can't you just make something up?

659
00:30:51,519 --> 00:30:52,319
The second thing.

660
00:30:52,720 --> 00:30:54,240
The two pieces of intel Yang mentioned.

661
00:30:54,400 --> 00:30:56,400
The photographer he mentioned is verified.

662
00:30:56,519 --> 00:30:57,240
He wasn't lying.

663
00:30:57,400 --> 00:30:58,240
Also,

664
00:30:58,359 --> 00:30:59,960
a group from Military Intel will arrive

665
00:30:59,960 --> 00:31:02,160
from Taiwan, China, within this week.

666
00:31:04,519 --> 00:31:05,440
The third thing.

667
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:08,640
Third is Ma Qi's unapproved interrogation.

668
00:31:08,640 --> 00:31:09,559
How should he be disciplined?

669
00:31:10,319 --> 00:31:12,039
The Military Intelligence Bureau is sending people over.

670
00:31:12,799 --> 00:31:13,559
It's the first time.

671
00:31:13,960 --> 00:31:14,720
Understood.

672
00:31:14,720 --> 00:31:15,720
Set the trap

673
00:31:15,720 --> 00:31:16,599
and wait for them to walk in.

674
00:31:17,240 --> 00:31:18,720
Turn up the heat this time.

675
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:19,440
Yes, sir.

676
00:31:23,920 --> 00:31:25,000
About the photographer.

677
00:31:25,200 --> 00:31:26,400
Are you going to keep this fish on the line?

678
00:31:27,119 --> 00:31:27,839
If not, arrest him.

679
00:31:28,440 --> 00:31:29,119
You can't guarantee

680
00:31:29,119 --> 00:31:30,319
that before Yang leaves the mainland,

681
00:31:30,319 --> 00:31:32,119
he won't change his mind, right?

682
00:31:32,519 --> 00:31:33,240
If we're arresting him,

683
00:31:33,240 --> 00:31:33,920
do it fast.

684
00:31:34,039 --> 00:31:34,640
Understood.

685
00:31:36,240 --> 00:31:36,759
Director.

686
00:31:37,119 --> 00:31:37,960
About Ma Qi.

687
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:38,920
Double the punishment.

688
00:31:39,559 --> 00:31:40,160
The state has its laws,

689
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:40,839
and the agency has its rules.

690
00:31:41,319 --> 00:31:42,079
A single punishment

691
00:31:42,079 --> 00:31:43,160
must be enough to teach him a lesson.

692
00:31:43,279 --> 00:31:44,559
It has to hurt for him to remember.

693
00:31:45,400 --> 00:31:47,160
What if others follow his example?

694
00:31:47,559 --> 00:31:48,480
What would become of the bureau?

695
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:48,960
Understood.

696
00:31:49,680 --> 00:31:50,279
Director,

697
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:51,599
I have one more minor thing.

698
00:31:51,920 --> 00:31:54,279
The trainees are about to graduate and be assigned.

699
00:31:54,480 --> 00:31:56,319
Section Two wants Jinlan.

700
00:31:56,359 --> 00:31:57,440
Anyone but Jinlan.

701
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,680
Take your pick.

702
00:31:59,720 --> 00:32:00,519
What about Huadong?

703
00:32:00,680 --> 00:32:01,480
Isn't he top of the class?

704
00:32:01,480 --> 00:32:02,359
An outstanding student?

705
00:32:02,640 --> 00:32:03,240
He's all yours.

706
00:32:03,240 --> 00:32:04,079
What more do you want?

707
00:32:04,200 --> 00:32:05,839
Just because you came from Section Three,

708
00:32:05,839 --> 00:32:07,200
you can't always play favorites with them.

709
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:09,400
I know exactly who is suited for what.

710
00:32:09,880 --> 00:32:10,799
Before, with Ma Qi,

711
00:32:11,079 --> 00:32:12,480
you said he was suited for surveillance.

712
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:14,000
But look what happened later.

713
00:32:15,839 --> 00:32:17,119
We have to look at the big picture.

714
00:32:17,880 --> 00:32:19,519
You'll understand when you're the Director.

715
00:32:24,440 --> 00:32:25,039
Who do you think

716
00:32:25,039 --> 00:32:26,759
he'll pick as his mentee this time?

717
00:32:26,759 --> 00:32:28,240
Definitely Huadong.

718
00:32:28,519 --> 00:32:29,160
A hundred percent.

719
00:32:29,160 --> 00:32:30,359
Out of all of us here,

720
00:32:30,359 --> 00:32:31,680
who can compete with Young Master Hua?

721
00:32:31,920 --> 00:32:32,920
If I were him,

722
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:34,160
I'd choose Jinlan.

723
00:32:34,400 --> 00:32:36,359
She was the only one who completed the mission this time.

724
00:32:36,359 --> 00:32:37,440
It won't happen.

725
00:32:38,400 --> 00:32:39,519
I've already been notified.

726
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:41,200
They want me doing full-time surveillance.

727
00:32:41,200 --> 00:32:42,559
That's backwards.

728
00:32:42,559 --> 00:32:43,480
You should be doing reconnaissance.

729
00:32:44,039 --> 00:32:45,000
Why the complete opposite?

730
00:32:45,440 --> 00:32:47,759
We're not in a position to be picky, are we?

731
00:32:49,079 --> 00:32:50,119
It doesn't matter anyway.

732
00:32:50,359 --> 00:32:51,640
I was planning to quit anyway.

733
00:32:52,400 --> 00:32:53,079
Why quit?

734
00:32:53,079 --> 00:32:53,960
Quit?

735
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:54,880
Why?

736
00:32:54,880 --> 00:32:55,319
Yeah, Jinlan.

737
00:32:56,319 --> 00:32:58,400
Taking the exam for this was my family's idea anyway.

738
00:32:58,440 --> 00:32:59,759
Police, prosecutors, State Security...

739
00:32:59,799 --> 00:33:02,039
My dad thinks working here is more stable.

740
00:33:02,200 --> 00:33:03,400
Actually, at first,

741
00:33:03,400 --> 00:33:05,559
I couldn't tell State and Police apart.

742
00:33:05,880 --> 00:33:07,079
There are too many rules here.

743
00:33:07,079 --> 00:33:08,119
I prefer it on the outside.

744
00:33:08,279 --> 00:33:09,799
You have to take risks in life.

745
00:33:10,039 --> 00:33:11,000
With reform and opening up,

746
00:33:11,160 --> 00:33:12,200
you have to fight to win.

747
00:33:12,359 --> 00:33:13,519
Going abroad, going into business...

748
00:33:13,640 --> 00:33:14,839
Women are just as capable as men.

749
00:33:15,039 --> 00:33:15,839
My mom said that.

750
00:33:15,920 --> 00:33:16,960
She's from Quanzhou.

751
00:33:17,839 --> 00:33:18,440
It's decided.

752
00:33:19,240 --> 00:33:20,759
I'll write my resignation letter when I get home.

753
00:33:20,880 --> 00:33:22,279
We'll see when the higher-ups approve it.

754
00:33:26,200 --> 00:33:27,359
Look at Brother Qi.

755
00:33:27,680 --> 00:33:28,599
He's become so diligent.

756
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:30,279
During the meeting,

757
00:33:30,279 --> 00:33:31,119
he was serving tea and pouring water.

758
00:33:31,119 --> 00:33:32,480
Now he's fixing tables and chairs.

759
00:33:33,839 --> 00:33:35,000
He's making himself useful.

760
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:36,240
When you have something on your mind,

761
00:33:36,279 --> 00:33:37,720
you find ways to keep busy.

762
00:33:37,960 --> 00:33:39,799
He needs to put on a good show right now.

763
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:41,599
He's afraid the bosses will discipline him.

764
00:33:42,119 --> 00:33:43,240
Do you think I'm afraid?

765
00:33:43,240 --> 00:33:45,920
What could Brother Qi possibly be afraid of?

766
00:33:47,480 --> 00:33:48,880
Since you got back,

767
00:33:49,039 --> 00:33:51,160
I feel like you're even bolder than before.

768
00:33:51,240 --> 00:33:53,200
If the bosses really discipline you this time,

769
00:33:53,279 --> 00:33:53,960
what will you do?

770
00:33:53,960 --> 00:33:55,319
I'll do what needs to be done.

771
00:33:55,960 --> 00:33:57,480
If worst comes to worst, I'll just leave.

772
00:33:58,200 --> 00:33:59,519
There's always a place for me somewhere.

773
00:33:59,839 --> 00:34:01,799
Here's the new recruit assignment list.

774
00:34:02,160 --> 00:34:02,960
Li Fengge,

775
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:04,160
pass it around for everyone to see.

776
00:34:04,160 --> 00:34:05,200
The usual rules apply.

777
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:06,000
Mentorship.

778
00:34:06,599 --> 00:34:07,720
They're all promising talents.

779
00:34:18,840 --> 00:34:19,960
The food is on the table.

780
00:34:20,320 --> 00:34:21,400
And you're still fiddling with the chairs.

781
00:34:21,519 --> 00:34:23,119
Grab your chopsticks or it'll be gone.

782
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:24,599
Let's sort everyone else out first.

783
00:34:24,599 --> 00:34:25,280
I'll take whichever.

784
00:34:25,280 --> 00:34:26,159
I'm not picky.

785
00:34:26,280 --> 00:34:27,519
I guess you're just not hungry.

786
00:34:27,519 --> 00:34:28,519
This batch of rookies,

787
00:34:28,599 --> 00:34:29,440
they have good potential.

788
00:34:29,599 --> 00:34:30,760
Wu Jiali knows best.

789
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:32,719
No more sending anyone back like before.

790
00:34:32,719 --> 00:34:33,360
They're just average.

791
00:34:33,360 --> 00:34:34,119
Just to make up the numbers.

792
00:34:34,679 --> 00:34:35,280
The ones we recruit now

793
00:34:35,280 --> 00:34:36,719
are just book-smart students.

794
00:34:37,039 --> 00:34:37,960
Every single one of them is too obedient.

795
00:34:37,960 --> 00:34:38,760
With so little real-world experience,

796
00:34:38,880 --> 00:34:40,239
how can they do our line of work?

797
00:34:40,360 --> 00:34:41,960
Go ask those young people today.

798
00:34:41,960 --> 00:34:43,119
Some haven't even been in a relationship,

799
00:34:43,119 --> 00:34:43,960
believe it or not.

800
00:34:47,159 --> 00:34:47,760
Xiao Ma,

801
00:34:47,920 --> 00:34:49,400
what you're saying makes no sense.

802
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:50,760
Which key operator

803
00:34:50,760 --> 00:34:52,519
didn't start out as a rookie?

804
00:34:52,960 --> 00:34:55,360
Experience is accumulated bit by bit.

805
00:34:55,360 --> 00:34:55,960
See?

806
00:34:57,960 --> 00:34:59,360
Sister is right to correct me.

807
00:34:59,599 --> 00:35:01,639
I need to raise my awareness and study more.

808
00:35:01,800 --> 00:35:03,039
Enough chitchat.

809
00:35:03,039 --> 00:35:04,280
The intel on the Photographer

810
00:35:04,280 --> 00:35:05,159
is officially on the table.

811
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:07,159
Catching targets, finding clues, and training rookies.

812
00:35:07,159 --> 00:35:08,760
Three in one. Get ready to dig in.

813
00:35:10,119 --> 00:35:11,760
Ma Qi, come here for a second.

814
00:35:13,880 --> 00:35:14,880
Got a cigarette?

815
00:35:18,599 --> 00:35:19,960
If your wife kicks the door down yelling,

816
00:35:19,960 --> 00:35:20,760
don't say I gave it to you.

817
00:35:21,039 --> 00:35:21,559
Got a light?

818
00:35:21,559 --> 00:35:22,119
I don't even smoke.

819
00:35:22,119 --> 00:35:23,320
Why would I have a light?

820
00:35:23,320 --> 00:35:24,639
I just pocketed this cigarette

821
00:35:24,639 --> 00:35:25,519
when someone treated me to a meal.

822
00:35:25,559 --> 00:35:26,519
They treated you to a meal,

823
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:28,239
but didn't even give you a box of matches?

824
00:35:29,719 --> 00:35:30,400
Alright.

825
00:35:30,679 --> 00:35:32,079
You can smoke anywhere you want.

826
00:35:32,239 --> 00:35:33,960
No need to sneak around here.

827
00:35:33,960 --> 00:35:34,880
Let's get down to business.

828
00:35:35,159 --> 00:35:36,639
What disciplinary action did I get?

829
00:35:37,159 --> 00:35:38,159
In light of your

830
00:35:38,159 --> 00:35:40,000
mistake of unauthorized interrogations,

831
00:35:40,320 --> 00:35:41,559
you've been given a demerit.

832
00:35:43,639 --> 00:35:44,440
I figured as much.

833
00:35:44,760 --> 00:35:45,440
Let this be a warning.

834
00:35:45,679 --> 00:35:46,559
If it happens again,

835
00:35:46,840 --> 00:35:47,840
you'll be handing in your badge.

836
00:35:47,880 --> 00:35:48,599
Not bad.

837
00:35:49,159 --> 00:35:50,199
It's lighter than I expected.

838
00:35:50,400 --> 00:35:51,320
I thought this time

839
00:35:51,320 --> 00:35:52,679
you'd definitely have me hand in my badge.

840
00:35:52,960 --> 00:35:53,920
What kind of attitude is that?

841
00:35:54,239 --> 00:35:55,320
What kind of attitude can I have?

842
00:35:55,480 --> 00:35:56,960
You're being punished for disregarding the rules.

843
00:35:57,280 --> 00:35:58,000
Last time during surveillance,

844
00:35:58,000 --> 00:35:59,639
you changed the deployment points without authorization.

845
00:35:59,760 --> 00:36:00,840
This businessman from Taiwan, China,

846
00:36:00,960 --> 00:36:02,280
you bypassed reporting procedures again.

847
00:36:02,280 --> 00:36:03,599
You always think the ends justify the means.

848
00:36:03,599 --> 00:36:04,920
During those years abroad,

849
00:36:04,920 --> 00:36:06,119
with all the things I did,

850
00:36:06,199 --> 00:36:08,000
could I ask for instructions on every one?

851
00:36:08,000 --> 00:36:10,039
Would there be enough time to get approval?

852
00:36:10,039 --> 00:36:12,199
Doesn't everything rely on timing and judgment?

853
00:36:12,199 --> 00:36:13,719
A commander in the field ignores orders from above.

854
00:36:13,719 --> 00:36:14,199
Now that I'm back,

855
00:36:14,199 --> 00:36:15,639
I just have to obediently follow your orders.

856
00:36:15,639 --> 00:36:16,280
I get it.

857
00:36:18,480 --> 00:36:19,440
During those years,

858
00:36:20,360 --> 00:36:22,079
you carried a lot on your own.

859
00:36:22,239 --> 00:36:23,400
The bureau knows that very well.

860
00:36:23,920 --> 00:36:25,400
But you're not out there anymore.

861
00:36:25,639 --> 00:36:26,559
When you act on your own

862
00:36:26,559 --> 00:36:27,480
and take unauthorized actions,

863
00:36:28,039 --> 00:36:29,960
everyone else has to clean up your mess.

864
00:36:29,960 --> 00:36:31,000
One slight mistake,

865
00:36:31,199 --> 00:36:32,840
and all our efforts go down the drain.

866
00:36:33,119 --> 00:36:34,159
I hear you loud and clear.

867
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:35,800
Let's leave it at that.

868
00:36:35,880 --> 00:36:36,840
I've got things to do later.

869
00:36:37,119 --> 00:36:37,679
Wait.

870
00:36:40,400 --> 00:36:41,760
Any other instructions?

871
00:36:43,239 --> 00:36:44,159
If not, I'm leaving.

872
00:36:44,719 --> 00:36:45,960
In future meetings,

873
00:36:46,760 --> 00:36:47,679
don't do

874
00:36:47,679 --> 00:36:49,199
the tea-spilling, ankle-twisting act.

875
00:36:49,920 --> 00:36:51,039
Putting on an act like that

876
00:36:51,760 --> 00:36:52,760
is completely unnecessary.

877
00:36:58,880 --> 00:37:00,000
About your application for an overseas posting,

878
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:00,960
the Bureau rejected it again.

879
00:37:01,599 --> 00:37:03,039
Going overseas is off the table.

880
00:37:03,400 --> 00:37:04,360
You made a mistake.

881
00:37:04,480 --> 00:37:05,119
Your cover is completely blown.

882
00:37:05,239 --> 00:37:06,440
How could you possibly go back?

883
00:37:31,639 --> 00:37:33,079
I reported it once already.

884
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:34,119
But you wouldn't listen.

885
00:37:34,239 --> 00:37:35,559
You thought I didn't push hard enough.

886
00:37:36,360 --> 00:37:37,960
You even went over my head. Did it work?

887
00:37:38,639 --> 00:37:39,719
Here's your answer now.

888
00:37:40,119 --> 00:37:41,199
It's been officially rejected.

889
00:37:41,960 --> 00:37:42,840
You've tried everything,

890
00:37:43,280 --> 00:37:44,360
so you shouldn't have any regrets.

891
00:37:47,199 --> 00:37:48,039
Refocus your mind,

892
00:37:48,800 --> 00:37:50,000
and do your job.

893
00:38:03,519 --> 00:38:05,079
I know you're upset about this.

894
00:38:05,280 --> 00:38:06,760
You're dead set on intelligence work,

895
00:38:07,239 --> 00:38:08,599
but they made you do surveillance.

896
00:38:08,599 --> 00:38:09,440
Playing defense.

897
00:38:09,719 --> 00:38:10,199
So you feel like

898
00:38:10,199 --> 00:38:12,039
your talents are going to waste.

899
00:38:12,039 --> 00:38:13,000
A perfectly good cat

900
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:13,840
isn't allowed to catch mice,

901
00:38:13,840 --> 00:38:14,840
and is forced to guard the house instead.

902
00:38:15,199 --> 00:38:16,760
Is it wrong to want to do what I excel at?

903
00:38:16,760 --> 00:38:17,719
You need to get this straight.

904
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:19,719
You earned your merits while acting as a shield.

905
00:38:19,719 --> 00:38:20,639
If I had always been a spear,

906
00:38:20,639 --> 00:38:21,519
I would've earned a lot more.

907
00:38:21,760 --> 00:38:22,599
Someone with your attitude

908
00:38:22,599 --> 00:38:23,519
and your kind of tactics,

909
00:38:23,519 --> 00:38:24,719
if the higher-ups weren't so tolerant,

910
00:38:24,719 --> 00:38:25,840
you'd have been fired long ago.

911
00:38:26,159 --> 00:38:28,360
Keeping you inside is for your own protection.

912
00:38:29,519 --> 00:38:30,519
Since I came back,

913
00:38:31,639 --> 00:38:33,840
I've been a sidekick, filing receipts.

914
00:38:34,239 --> 00:38:35,440
Now I even have to train a rookie.

915
00:38:35,559 --> 00:38:36,079
If you were in my shoes,

916
00:38:36,079 --> 00:38:36,920
wouldn't you feel frustrated?

917
00:38:37,239 --> 00:38:39,760
State Security means enduring grievances.

918
00:38:40,039 --> 00:38:41,159
Mastering surveillance logic

919
00:38:41,239 --> 00:38:42,119
and counter-tactics,

920
00:38:42,119 --> 00:38:44,320
aren't those what a spear needs most?

921
00:38:46,440 --> 00:38:47,679
Do your current job well first.

922
00:38:47,880 --> 00:38:48,800
Fix all your bad habits.

923
00:38:49,079 --> 00:38:50,039
Then we'll find an opportunity,

924
00:38:50,960 --> 00:38:52,440
and I'll submit the application for you.

925
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:55,880
Stop making these empty promises.

926
00:38:56,039 --> 00:38:56,880
It's pointless.

927
00:39:09,679 --> 00:39:10,800
Are you crazy?

928
00:39:11,199 --> 00:39:12,800
If you like it, just try it on.

929
00:39:12,800 --> 00:39:14,480
It costs nothing to try, what are you afraid of?

930
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:15,920
Forget it.

931
00:39:16,599 --> 00:39:18,039
Is it the same as when they first opened?

932
00:39:18,039 --> 00:39:19,280
Still ten yuan each?

933
00:39:19,559 --> 00:39:19,960
With that money,

934
00:39:19,960 --> 00:39:21,840
I could eat for a week at school!

935
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:22,920
Just don't worry about it.

936
00:39:22,920 --> 00:39:23,480
Eat this first.

937
00:39:23,480 --> 00:39:24,719
We'll go try it on after you finish.

938
00:39:25,480 --> 00:39:27,559
Look at that tag yourself.

939
00:39:27,559 --> 00:39:29,519
599 yuan! Are you crazy?

940
00:39:29,519 --> 00:39:30,199
I'd have to be crazy.

941
00:39:30,199 --> 00:39:31,280
Let's go, let's go.

942
00:39:31,559 --> 00:39:32,840
Anyway, eat one of these first.

943
00:39:32,840 --> 00:39:33,920
I'll take the rest back to your dorm.

944
00:39:33,920 --> 00:39:35,440
Make your roommates jealous tonight.

945
00:39:35,519 --> 00:39:36,639
Aren't you going to have one?

946
00:39:36,800 --> 00:39:37,400
I don't want any.

947
00:39:49,039 --> 00:39:49,960
What are you doing?

948
00:39:50,239 --> 00:39:51,159
Watch where you're going!

949
00:39:51,360 --> 00:39:52,159
Does it hurt?

950
00:39:53,559 --> 00:39:54,559
Look at my shoes.

951
00:39:54,679 --> 00:39:55,400
Sorry. Sorry, man.

952
00:39:55,400 --> 00:39:56,360
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. So sorry.

953
00:39:56,360 --> 00:39:58,199
Lu Zhifei, what are you doing?

954
00:39:58,440 --> 00:39:59,679
He hit us!

955
00:39:59,840 --> 00:40:00,800
What do you mean I hit you?

956
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:02,559
You guys clearly hit me, alright?

957
00:40:02,800 --> 00:40:03,800
How did we hit you?

958
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:05,079
Look at your front wheel.

959
00:40:05,400 --> 00:40:06,840
Didn't it run over my backpack strap?

960
00:40:07,199 --> 00:40:08,639
Look at my hamburger!

961
00:40:08,719 --> 00:40:09,840
Are you saying it was our fault?

962
00:40:09,840 --> 00:40:11,519
You guys are ridiculous.

963
00:40:11,800 --> 00:40:12,760
I was riding perfectly fine.

964
00:40:12,760 --> 00:40:14,480
I was going straight, north to south.

965
00:40:14,679 --> 00:40:16,079
You clearly hit me!

966
00:40:16,320 --> 00:40:17,119
You were going north-south.

967
00:40:17,119 --> 00:40:18,239
We were going east-west.

968
00:40:18,519 --> 00:40:19,760
We were going in a straight line.

969
00:40:20,039 --> 00:40:20,639
You were turning!

970
00:40:20,639 --> 00:40:21,800
Why didn't you look?

971
00:40:22,119 --> 00:40:23,440
Where are your eyes?

972
00:40:23,440 --> 00:40:24,840
Where are your eyes?

973
00:40:25,039 --> 00:40:26,559
Look at how you were riding!

974
00:40:26,559 --> 00:40:28,320
You almost rode right under my bike!

975
00:40:28,400 --> 00:40:28,880
Yeah!

976
00:40:28,880 --> 00:40:30,119
We're the Wuqiao Circus.

977
00:40:30,119 --> 00:40:31,880
You think we're performing acrobatics?

978
00:40:32,159 --> 00:40:33,719
What do you care how we ride?

979
00:40:33,719 --> 00:40:35,079
You're the one who wasn't looking.

980
00:40:35,079 --> 00:40:35,880
Are you saying it's my fault?

981
00:40:36,599 --> 00:40:37,719
My burger got crushed!

982
00:40:37,960 --> 00:40:38,639
Alright, alright.

983
00:40:38,880 --> 00:40:40,480
I won't stoop to your level.

984
00:40:40,480 --> 00:40:41,360
What are you doing?

985
00:40:41,480 --> 00:40:43,320
Don't move. Don't anyone move.

986
00:40:43,760 --> 00:40:45,039
Everyone, come take a look.

987
00:40:45,039 --> 00:40:46,920
Look, isn't that the bike

988
00:40:46,920 --> 00:40:48,599
that caught my backpack right there?

989
00:40:48,599 --> 00:40:50,360
Didn't it crush my hamburger?

990
00:40:50,360 --> 00:40:50,960
Forget it, forget it.

991
00:40:50,960 --> 00:40:52,039
Why should I forget it?

992
00:40:52,239 --> 00:40:53,000
You're unreasonable.

993
00:40:53,159 --> 00:40:53,920
What exactly do you want?

994
00:40:53,920 --> 00:40:54,719
What do you want?

995
00:40:54,880 --> 00:40:55,559
What do I want?

996
00:40:55,559 --> 00:40:56,320
Let's just talk reasonably.

997
00:40:56,320 --> 00:40:57,079
The hamburger.

998
00:40:57,079 --> 00:40:57,599
Pay for it.

999
00:40:57,960 --> 00:40:58,880
How much is a hamburger?

1000
00:40:58,960 --> 00:41:00,239
I just bought it at McDonald's.

1001
00:41:01,599 --> 00:41:02,360
Twenty.

1002
00:41:02,480 --> 00:41:03,239
Twenty?

1003
00:41:03,239 --> 00:41:04,760
I haven't even asked you to pay for my bike light!

1004
00:41:08,960 --> 00:41:09,760
I'm calling the police.

1005
00:41:09,960 --> 00:41:10,360
Go ahead.

1006
00:41:10,360 --> 00:41:11,519
Fine, call them.

1007
00:41:11,599 --> 00:41:12,360
Everyone saw it.

1008
00:41:12,360 --> 00:41:13,719
Whose fault is this anyway?

1009
00:41:14,039 --> 00:41:15,239
You think you can run?

1010
00:41:17,519 --> 00:41:18,840
A spy from Taiwan, China,

1011
00:41:18,920 --> 00:41:20,400
has been undercover here for a long time.

1012
00:41:20,559 --> 00:41:23,199
His daily life is confined to this box.

1013
00:41:23,199 --> 00:41:24,360
This suspect,

1014
00:41:24,360 --> 00:41:26,000
posing as a photographer,

1015
00:41:26,000 --> 00:41:27,719
has been highly active lately.

1016
00:41:27,800 --> 00:41:28,840
These two boxes,

1017
00:41:28,840 --> 00:41:30,599
the newspaper office and studio street,

1018
00:41:30,760 --> 00:41:32,559
might be his area of operations.

1019
00:41:32,559 --> 00:41:33,039
However,

1020
00:41:33,039 --> 00:41:35,360
But we still don't know his appearance.

1021
00:41:35,360 --> 00:41:36,519
We need to sift through them one by one.

1022
00:41:37,039 --> 00:41:39,280
We don't have many clues at the moment.

1023
00:41:39,440 --> 00:41:41,760
First, the suspect is male.

1024
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:43,239
And he's left-handed.

1025
00:41:43,440 --> 00:41:44,599
We also have a photo.

1026
00:41:44,599 --> 00:41:45,960
This is the only item confirmed

1027
00:41:45,960 --> 00:41:47,360
to belong to this person.

1028
00:41:47,639 --> 00:41:49,639
How do you know a left-hander took it?

1029
00:41:49,639 --> 00:41:51,639
You can't tell just by looking at the photo.

1030
00:41:51,639 --> 00:41:53,719
If this photographer stood before you,

1031
00:41:53,719 --> 00:41:54,840
and you only had one minute,

1032
00:41:55,119 --> 00:41:55,920
what would you look for?

1033
00:41:56,199 --> 00:41:57,320
Observe his subconscious reactions.

1034
00:41:57,519 --> 00:41:58,360
Figure out his dominant hand.

1035
00:41:58,360 --> 00:41:58,960
Right.

1036
00:41:59,199 --> 00:42:01,760
Changing lenses, unzipping bags, tripods.

1037
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:02,920
These are all details.

1038
00:42:04,480 --> 00:42:06,159
Then... how can we be sure

1039
00:42:06,159 --> 00:42:07,719
that he took this photo?

1040
00:42:08,079 --> 00:42:10,440
That's the source of the intelligence.

1041
00:42:10,760 --> 00:42:13,199
Like a hair dropped on the ground.

1042
00:42:13,480 --> 00:42:14,320
You pick up one,

1043
00:42:14,320 --> 00:42:15,239
he picks up another.

1044
00:42:15,239 --> 00:42:16,320
They start to add up.

1045
00:42:16,320 --> 00:42:18,280
Eventually, they're woven into a hat.

1046
00:42:18,280 --> 00:42:19,800
Whoever can wear this hat

1047
00:42:20,320 --> 00:42:21,599
is the person you're looking for.

1048
00:42:22,400 --> 00:42:23,239
Right now,

1049
00:42:23,239 --> 00:42:24,519
it's like picking radishes at a market.

1050
00:42:24,519 --> 00:42:26,760
Every vet with over 5 years of experience

1051
00:42:26,760 --> 00:42:27,840
will take a rookie.

1052
00:42:27,840 --> 00:42:28,599
Ma Qi,

1053
00:42:29,119 --> 00:42:31,400
you complained I didn't let you speak.

1054
00:42:31,400 --> 00:42:32,440
Today, you go first.

1055
00:42:32,760 --> 00:42:33,760
I don't mind.

1056
00:42:33,760 --> 00:42:34,559
Pick your partner.

1057
00:42:34,559 --> 00:42:35,199
Now.

1058
00:42:41,000 --> 00:42:41,719
Huadong.

1059
00:42:42,079 --> 00:42:42,679
Present.

1060
00:42:44,000 --> 00:42:45,000
Evaluate yourself.

1061
00:42:45,199 --> 00:42:46,199
Fast learner.

1062
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:47,199
Highly perceptive.

1063
00:42:47,360 --> 00:42:48,400
Excellent test-taker.

1064
00:42:48,559 --> 00:42:50,079
So I'll be just as capable on the job.

1065
00:42:52,559 --> 00:42:53,239
I think I'll go with him.

1066
00:42:53,239 --> 00:42:54,960
What was his name again? Chun-something?

1067
00:42:56,559 --> 00:42:57,360
Chunxiao.

1068
00:42:59,960 --> 00:43:01,199
Was there a problem with my answer?

1069
00:43:01,440 --> 00:43:02,119
What do you think?

1070
00:43:08,159 --> 00:43:08,880
I'm Wang Kai,

1071
00:43:09,239 --> 00:43:10,599
inviting you to watch the drama

1072
00:43:10,880 --> 00:43:11,559
*Confrontation*.

1073
00:43:11,559 --> 00:43:12,599
Why did you buy fish again?

1074
00:43:12,599 --> 00:43:13,760
And such an expensive one, too.

1075
00:43:13,760 --> 00:43:14,840
I didn't buy any fish.

1076
00:43:15,760 --> 00:43:16,639
Even if I bought a lottery ticket,

1077
00:43:16,639 --> 00:43:18,199
I wouldn't be this lucky.

1078
00:43:18,400 --> 00:43:19,400
I can't drink anymore.

1079
00:43:19,559 --> 00:43:20,639
I've been vomiting and having diarrhea.

1080
00:43:20,880 --> 00:43:22,119
Your brother-in-law set this up.

1081
00:43:22,119 --> 00:43:23,360
You have to show him some respect.

1082
00:43:23,840 --> 00:43:25,159
Rather than investigating passively,

1083
00:43:25,159 --> 00:43:26,239
we should take the initiative.

1084
00:43:26,400 --> 00:43:27,320
After a massive screening,

1085
00:43:27,400 --> 00:43:28,920
we narrowed it down to four left-handers.

1086
00:43:29,559 --> 00:43:31,079
No. 02, Lane 75.

1087
00:43:31,119 --> 00:43:32,039
I came here three times.

1088
00:43:32,039 --> 00:43:33,239
No one was home.

1089
00:43:34,559 --> 00:43:35,400
I've seen him before.

1090
00:43:35,400 --> 00:43:36,159
He delivered a parcel to me once.

1091
00:43:36,159 --> 00:43:37,199
He's the left-hander.
